  "_readme": [
    "This file holds one block per DOCUMENT, because the PDF holds more than one.",
    "Each block states the pages it covers, the types those pages name, and the",
    "value every key of that document's own form should come back with.",
    "\"\" means the document does not print this; null means not checked; a list",
    "means the page prints the value in more than one way and any of them counts.",
    "The file's headline score pools every block -- see app._merge_field_scores."
  ],
  "_note": [
    "Four documents: two monthly cleaning charges, each a tax invoice followed",
    "by the receipt for it. The tax invoice is copy 1 of its set and the receipt",
    "copy 5, so the two share one number -- which is what เลขที่ใบกำกับ prints on",
    "both. No requirement covers TAX_INVOICE, so those two blocks are scored as",
    "found-only; the two receipts are held to the receipt requirement's seven.",
    "Neither receipt records a payment: no box is ticked and the cheque, bank,",
    "date and amount lines are all blank, so payment_date and cheque_number are",
    "empty on both."
  ],
